    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>It consists of two octahedra sharing one edge with a \(\text{Cr–O–Cr}\) angle of \(180^\circ\), where all eight \(\text{Cr–O}\) bonds are of equal length (\(163\text{ pm}\)).</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
