    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>It consists of two square planar units joined linearly with a \(\text{Cr–O–Cr}\) angle of \(109.5^\circ\) and seven completely equivalent \(\text{Cr–O}\) bonds.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
