    <name>
      <text>NEET_UG_CHEMISTRY_THE_D_AND_F_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_DIAGRAM_MCQ_Q02 - Atomic radii trends and lanthanoid contraction</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
